WEBVTT

00:00:05.424 --> 00:00:11.219
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:16.466
Type "Naira" in the Search box.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:21.584
Click Edit Counting Money in Naira.

00:00:21.834 --> 00:00:27.834
Check that the Title says
what viewers will learn.

00:00:29.553 --> 00:00:35.553
Type "Learn to count and compare
naira." in the Description box.

00:00:37.009 --> 00:00:41.063
Tick Maths.

00:00:41.313 --> 00:00:46.913
Type "naira, money,
counting" in the Tags box.

00:00:47.163 --> 00:00:52.765
Select G from the Maturity rating list.

00:00:53.015 --> 00:00:56.867
Click Save changes.

00:00:57.117 --> 00:01:03.049
Wait until you see Changes saved.
